# ── Secrets & Firebase config ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Repo is PRIVATE — Firebase config files are included intentionally.
# If you ever make this repo public, remove these files first and rotate your keys.
#
# android/app/google-services.json   ← included (private repo)
# ios/Runner/GoogleService-Info.plist ← included (private repo)
# lib/firebase_options.dart           ← included (private repo)

